            "review_text": "Amelia B\n17 contributions\n0\nThis local dish lives rent free in my mind.\nApr 2024 • Couples\nThis is probably the best thing we ate in Vietnam - authentically local, fresh and delicious. We will be back for this again. Use all the garnishes and seasonings on the table and enjoy!\nInsider tip:\nWe ate street food each and everyday of our trip to Vietnam and this was one of the best places all around.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 11, 2024",
