            "review_text": "Amy H\nBristol, United Kingdom34 contributions\n0\nTry with a guide\nFeb 2024 • Friends\nWe saw a video of this place and were really excited to go. We travelled to this area specifically for this restaurant. We were given one dish and when asked for more they said no. Would suggest going with a tour guide as they did not like us (tourists). They didn’t serve us for a long time and ignored us. While everyone around us was being served lots of different dishes. Then served us one small dish and we asked for more using google translate and they said no again.\nRead more\nWritten February 26, 2024",
