            "review_text": "Leannie\nHong Kong, China3214 contributions\n1\nInteresting to watch being prepared\nAug 2022 • Friends\nThis was one of our stops on a foodie tour organized by friends in Hanoi. It is rather small but they easily managed to squeeze in the 16 of us! This was my first experience of banh cuon and I think watching the lady prepare them is part of the experience, it was fascinating to watch. I can't say I was the biggest fan of the texture of these but these were tasty inside, I think they would go better with a soy sauce rather than the stock they provided for dipping but that's just my personal preference\nRead more\nWritten August 21, 2022",
