            "review_title": "Review at Banh Cuon Mrs Xuan",
            "review_text": "188petere\nBrisbane, Australia1758 contributions\n0\nWent to this cafe on a food walking tour\nSep 2019\nA very small indoor cafe with a few tables on the footpath with the cafe only serving 1 dish - the Banh Cuon which is a thin, wide sheet of steamed fermented rice batter filled with a mixture of cooked seasoned ground pork, mushroom & shallots. \n\nWe were told that the cafe was made famous by Mrs Xuan who operated it for many years before her death, with he daughter now taking over the duties & doing the cooking at the front of th store.\n\nQite an experience sitting on small wooden stools/crates whilst eating this dish - only cafe I have been to that serves 1 meal.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 2, 2019",
